#: r2/templates/adminantispam.html:76
msgid "CleanTalk (cleantalk.org, a paid service) checks sign-ups, posts, comments and messages without asking anything of people. Spam sign-ups are refused; spam posts, comments and messages are saved but hidden as spam, for moderators to review in their spam queue. If CleanTalk can't be reached, everything goes through."
msgstr "CleanTalk (cleantalk.org, un servicio de pago) revisa registros, publicaciones, comentarios y mensajes sin pedir nada a nadie. Los registros de spam se rechazan; las publicaciones, comentarios y mensajes de spam se guardan pero se ocultan como spam, para que los moderadores los revisen en su cola de spam. Si no se puede contactar con CleanTalk, todo pasa."

